<title>UK: Novorossiisk berth one shut due to swell - shippin.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk berth one shut due to swell - shippin.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berth number one at Russia's Black Sea oil port of Novorossiisk was closed on Monday due to a heavy swell, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>Berth number one is the only one of Novorossiisk's berths that can accommodate large tankers of between 100,000 and 140,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>&quot;The berth was closed this morning, but the swell can drop off very quickly and we're hoping it will open again today some time,&quot; a shipping source said.</p>
<p>Berth number one is scheduled to close for two weeks on December 9 for maintenance.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
